## Command

```shell
biome lint --suppress file.js
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": ["no foo.grit"]
}
```

## `file.js`

```js
foo(1);

```

## `no foo.grit`

```grit
language js

`foo($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span=$args, message="Do not call foo", severity="error")
}

```

# Termination Message

```block
plugin ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × Error(s) during loading of plugins:
    The plugin file name no foo.grit must not contain whitespace, :, or (, because the file name is the plugin name used in suppression comments.
  


```
